output/
tmp/
__pycache__/
* [0-9].png

# Extracted IE reference art (Beamdog/BioWare) - regenerate locally, never commit.
ArtSource/References/IEComposition/

# Superseded city-bake iterations. Each is a full-ward re-render at 40-90 MB a
# plate, none of them shipped: the runtime reads Resources/Art, and the scripts
# in ArtSource/Processing rebuild these from absolute paths on demand. Tracking
# them put ~2.2 GB into a single push, which GitHub refuses. Keep the masters
# that a shipped plate is actually cut from (SableRow/IEOutdoorV01), not the
# iterations that led to them.
ArtSource/Generated/CityDistrict/V2/IE80x60/
ArtSource/Generated/CityDistrict/V2/IECompositionV05/
ArtSource/Generated/CityDistrict/V2/IEMonolithV06/
# V07-V12 are the Sable Row iteration workspaces behind V13 — sources, door
# candidates, review renders and raws. Same policy as the line above: they are
# how the accepted monolith was reached, not the monolith.
ArtSource/Generated/CityDistrict/V2/IEMonolithV07/
ArtSource/Generated/CityDistrict/V2/IEMonolithV08/
ArtSource/Generated/CityDistrict/V2/IEMonolithV09/
ArtSource/Generated/CityDistrict/V2/IEMonolithV10/
ArtSource/Generated/CityDistrict/V2/IEMonolithV11/
ArtSource/Generated/CityDistrict/V2/IEMonolithV12/
ArtSource/Generated/CityDistrict/V2/IEMonolithV13/
# V15 full-ward master is 109 MB — GitHub's blob cap is 100 MB. Pages, JSON and
# the shipped Resources/Art plate stay tracked; this PNG is regenerated locally.
ArtSource/Generated/CityDistrict/V2/IEMonolithV15/masters/*.png
# V16 / opening V02 are rebuilt from the retained native Image Generator
# sources and their hashed provenance. Composition-only edit targets and
# packaged duplicates are derived; the assembled Sable PNG exceeds 100 MB.
ArtSource/Generated/CityDistrict/V2/IENativeDetailV16/targets/
ArtSource/Generated/CityDistrict/V2/IENativeDetailV16/masters/*.png
ArtSource/Generated/CityDistrict/V2/IENativeDetailV16/pages/
ArtSource/Generated/Exterior/NativeDetailV02/targets/
ArtSource/Generated/Exterior/NativeDetailV02/masters/*.png
ArtSource/Generated/Exterior/NativeDetailV02/pages/

# IE colour-model working output. `EncodeQA/` and `MaterialMasks/` are review
# sheets regenerated on demand by qa_ie_avatar_encode.py and
# author_material_masks.py; `gradients_manifest.json` beside them is tracked,
# because it is what qa_ie_palette_port.py checks the shipped tables against.
ArtSource/Generated/IE/EncodeQA/
ArtSource/Generated/IE/MaterialMasks/
ArtSource/Generated/IE/SuperXBR/

# Blender writes a .blend1 backup beside every save; the .blend itself is
# generated by build_voss_v23.py and the backup is noise.
*.blend1

# Local backup of pre-rewrite history; do not commit.
.git.old_history/

# Local art pipeline — keep on disk, never push (GitHub 2 GiB pack limit).
ArtSource/
